  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Visit Jordanian Ministers &#x2013; Investment Forum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to facilitate a business forum during a high level visit from the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan on the 28th January 2026. The visit is part of an European Union (EU) Roadshow that is coordinated by the EU. Objective: engage European (Dutch) companies and investors, mobilise participation at the Investment Forum that should take place in Amman in April 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
